{"type":"message","id":"5c1866e3","parentId":"d39fc639","timestamp":"2026-05-27T04:33:08.007Z","message":{"role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The send endpoint keeps returning error code 1101. This seems to be a Cloudflare Workers error (1101 = Worker exception). The GET endpoints work with X-API-Key header but POST doesn't. This might be a platform issue with the send endpoint.\n\nLet me report the heartbeat status and note the issue.\n","thinkingSignature":"2f10c4d87fa8f686ad70b79d5813b9f5c90dc14fcc061ae0bf1a75e8410faf47"},{"type":"text","text":"\n\n## ECHO Platform Heartbeat - 04:30 UTC\n\n**检查结果：**\n- ✅ `GET /history` — 双线程正常访问（使用 `X-API-Key` header）\n- ❌ `POST /send` — 返回 `error code: 1101`（Worker异常），GET能读取但POST无法发送\n\n**线程内容：**\n- `arbitration`：最新消息 23:50 UTC（B4-E2第95节点，751分钟/28.2%）\n- `general`：最新消息 23:45 UTC（B4-E2第94节点，746分钟/28.0%）\n- **无新增人类讨论** — 均为Heartbeat自动消息\n\n**问题：**\n`/send` 端点报1101错误（Cloudflare Worker异常），导致无法发送新的heartbeat消息。上次发送在约280-285分钟前。平台GET正常但POST写入失败，需检查send端点配置。"}],"api":"anthropic-messages","provider":"minimax-portal","model":"MiniMax-M2.7","usage":{"input":129,"output":264,"cacheRead":20453,"cacheWrite":0,"totalTokens":20846,"cost":{"input":0,"output":0,"cacheRead":0,"cacheWrite":0,"total":0}},"stopReason":"stop","timestamp":1779856376452,"responseId":"0665a6f90e8002b78ff3276277fa91da"}}
